  "bodyHash": "5eca88dc6edfc638",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/695/948/sbt_banner.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"722\" height=\"183\"></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此模组允许你在背包中鼠标悬停在潜影盒上时，按下<code>shift</code>键查看其内容的预览窗口。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>同时支持 Fabric 和 MinecraftForge</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong>下载</strong></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"> <strong><strong>Fabric：</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678389\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639021\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827832\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827838\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a> (旧版：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/3999638\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/3999663\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/2975404\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.15.2</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/2788715\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.14.4</a>) </strong> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>MinecraftForge：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678391\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639022\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.6</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827833\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/4827839\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a> </strong> </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/6678392\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.21.7</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip/files/5639023\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">1.20.6</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Fabric 平台：</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://fabricmc.net/use/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"> API</a>&nbsp;是必需的&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">推荐使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>（非必需）进行游戏内配置</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">紧凑预览</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">将鼠标悬停在物品上时，按下<code>shift</code>键（默认设置）。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/159/compact_preview_2.png\" alt=\"紧凑预览截图\" width=\"465\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">完整预览</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">将鼠标悬停在物品上时，按下<code>alt+shift</code>键（默认设置）可查看其完整内容，其中每个堆叠物品都会显示在正确的槽位中。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/163/full_preview_1.png\" alt=\"完整预览截图\" width=\"464\" height=\"254\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">其他容器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">该预览功能同样适用于在创造模式下使用<code>Ctrl + 鼠标右键</code>（拾取方块）获取的物品，例如箱子、熔炉、木桶等...</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">同时兼容大多数模组添加的容器。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/160/other_containers_preview.png\" alt=\"其他容器预览截图\" width=\"464\" height=\"261\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">战利品表</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">如果悬停的物品关联了战利品表，其名称将显示在物品提示中。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:16px\">此选项默认处于关闭状态。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/285/169/loot_table_tooltip_info.png\" alt=\"战利品表信息截图\" width=\"467\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">高度可配置</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模组的大部分功能均可通过配置菜单进行调整。要进入配置界面，请在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组菜单</a>中选择<code>ShulkerBoxTooltip</code>，然后点击齿轮图标。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">有关各选项的详细说明，请参阅游戏内文档或<a href=\"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip/wiki/Configuration-Options\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。配置文件位于<code>&lt;minecraft 文件夹&gt;/config/shulkerboxtooltip.json5</code></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/95/config-mk2.png\" alt=\"配置界面截图\" width=\"474\" height=\"248\"></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">颜色主题！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">预览窗口的颜色会根据潜影盒的颜色自动变化，您可以在配置中禁用此功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">服务端支持</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模组也支持安装至服务端（可选），以提供额外功能，例如末影箱预览。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
